.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK SEARCH"
.SH NAME
hamstik work search \- Search Organization Work Items with SqueakQL
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work search [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search Organization Work Items with SqueakQL
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I QUERY
SqueakQL expression (inline)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file
Read the expression from a file (`-` for stdin) instead of inline
.TP
.B --saved
Run a saved query by name instead of an inline expression
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum items per page (endpoint maximum is 100 or 200)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque continuation cursor
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages
Choices: true, false
